This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a MUTATION BATTERY behind a shipped fixture: every mutant edits a copy of core's own
validate-handoff-evidence.sh (written beside its siblings in a copy of core/scripts/) to restore a
defect the SMOKE-SURFACE-IGNORED arm was built against, and scores it against the arms of
smoke-surface-ignored, which ships and which this fixture sources. A consumer runs those arms; the
mutants prove they can fail, which is the distribution's property to establish, not the consumer's.
